              "type": "text",
              "id": "I0hobk",
              "name": "Trama is a cloud task ma",
              "fill": "$d-text-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "Trama is a cloud task manager (web + mobile) that connects to any issue tracker. Each task — and each subtask — links exactly one Delta thread. Work starts in Delta with the /trama skill: the agent reads the task, links its own thread and syncs a read-only record (summary, decisions, events, changes). Time spent is tracked per task.",
              "lineHeight": 1.55,
              "fontFamily": "$d-sans",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
