                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "a2EsQ",
                      "name": "GitHub tokens last 8 hou",
                      "fill": "$d-text",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "GitHub tokens last 8 hours and GitLab tokens 2 hours. A 10 minute window leaves room for one retry with backoff before expiry, without refreshing so often that it hits rate limits [1]. GitLab can override it per provider, as @mreed asked [2]. Backfill for already-expired tokens is handled separately as a one-off job [3].",
